<title>POLAND: Mostostal Z wins PLN 1.7 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Mostostal Z wins PLN 1.7 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction firm Mostostal Zabrze SA signed a 1.7-milion-zloty contract with an Icelandic firm for the supply of over 300 million tonnes of steel construction, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said work on the project should be completed by December 20.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
